# React / Next.js

- App Router only. Pages live under `src/app/[locale]/`. Call `setRequestLocale` on each page. Keep `page.tsx` a server component when possible.
- Use next-intl for copy (`useTranslations` / `getTranslations`) and localized strings on content (`tLocalized`).
- Follow sibling components in the same folder. Reuse `ThemeRegistry`, `AppShell` and SEO helpers in `src/lib/seo.ts`.
- Do not add `useMemo` / `useCallback` without a clear performance reason.
- Name booleans with `is`, `has`, `can`, or `should`. Prefer `is` for flags.
